comp('C1','Intake and identity gate','Code: validation',['T1','T4.3'],['principal:{tenantId,memberId,scopes:string[],active:bool}; required, server authenticated','command:{type:submit|cancel,caseId?:uuid,expectedRevision?:int,requestId:uuid}; submit requires policyId,docIds[] (may be empty); cancel requires caseId and expectedRevision','manifest:DocumentRef[]; each tenantId/memberId/docId/version/hash required'],['intake:{status:ready|hold|cancel|reject,caseId:uuid?,revision:int?,reason:enum,duplicateOf:uuid?}','reason:OK|MISSING_DOCS|IDENTITY|DUPLICATE_CANDIDATE|EXACT_REPLAY|UNSUPPORTED|CONFLICT|CANCELLED; exact replay returns original record'], 'Reject unauthorized requests before reading medical data. Exact key tenant+requestId has a unique digest; same key/different payload is CONFLICT. Semantic match on member/admission/provider/bill number is candidate only, held for human correlation. Cancellation must own member and expected revision. Intake creates no external claim action.','Authenticated submitter has case:create or case:cancel scope limited to own tenant/member; revision conflicts do not overwrite.')
comp('C2','Evidence and temporal policy reader','Code: tools',['T2'],['bound:{tenantId,memberId,caseId,revision}; required','docRefs:DocumentRef[]; policyId:string; admissionDate:date?; sourceDocs contain page text and OCR confidence','registry:{versions:[{id,hash,effectiveFrom,effectiveTo,selectionBasis,memberBinding,rulePack}],endorsements:[]}; required authoritative reader'],['evidence:{status:ready|hold,reason:OK|MISSING|UNREADABLE|SUBJECT|AMBIGUOUS_POLICY|UNAVAILABLE,policyVersion?:string,policyHash?:sha256,documents:Span[],rules?:RulePack,ledgerSequence?:int}','Span:{docId,version,page:int,start:int,end:int,text:string,hash:sha256}; all references tenant/member bound'], 'Logical readEvidence and readPolicy APIs filter tenant/member at repository boundary; 10-second timeout, one retry for unavailable, no retry for subject mismatch. Governing policy is selected using approved date basis from H2, not automatically latest. Missing basis, overlapping intervals, conflicting endorsements or unreadable dates produce hold. Effective date boundaries are half-open. Admission/discharge exact dates must be confirmed against cited spans before calculation.','Read-only scoped service with documented medical-data purpose. Never fetch by unscoped docId.')
comp('C3','Structured fact extraction and explanation','Agents (LLM)',['T2','T3'],['evidence:Span[]; confirmed policy/rules immutable hash; required','phase:extract_and_explain; max 50 pages and 200 bill lines (H9 proposed support limit), remove direct identifiers before inference','approvedFields:{admissionDate,dischargeDate,diagnosisText,roomClass,billLines:[lineId,category,amountMinor,serviceDate,quantity],coverageClauses}; schema only'],['proposal:{status:supported|abstain,facts:Fact[],coverage:recommend_eligible|recommend_reject|review,evidenceRefs:SpanRef[],uncertainties:string[],explanation:string}','Fact:{field,value,citation:{docId,version,page,start,end}}; coverage is advisory; monetary results must come from C4','modelError:SCHEMA|TIMEOUT|UNAVAILABLE; any uncited/conflicting material fact becomes abstain'], 'Single bounded extraction call with advisory coverage rationale. Documents are data, never instructions; no tools, no network, no writes. One schema repair retry with same snapshot is allowed; timeout/unavailable abstains. Code checks every required citation and never uses model confidence as approval. Final narrative combines immutable cited clause text and C4 amounts; model cannot invent rules.','No business action permission; human resolves coverage interpretation and clinical/necessity disputes.')
comp('C4','Rules and money verifier','Code: validation',['T3'],['proposal:typed C3 output; evidence and policy snapshot required','rulePack:{version,currency,selectionBasis,dayCount,roomCapMinorPerDay,proportionalRule:explicit_none|explicit_formula|unspecified,deductibleMinor,coinsuranceBps,benefitCaps,rounding,remainingCoverMinor}; all approved required','ledgerSequence:int; dates:ISO dates, amounts:int>=0; no floating point money'],['calculation:{status:ready|hold,reason:OK|FACT_CONFLICT|RULE_MISSING|BILL_MISMATCH|DATE|STALE|INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE,lines:[{lineId,billedMinor,eligibleMinor,deductionMinor,ruleId,evidenceRefs}],totalEligibleMinor:int?,currency:string,policyHash:sha256,ledgerSequence:int}','verified:{factCitationsValid:bool,totalsReconciled:bool,rulesComplete:bool}; explanation has arithmetic trace'], 'Reconcile bill totals exactly, duplicate line IDs reject to hold; missing categories/negative amounts/currency mismatches hold. Day count follows pack; HC1 inclusive days. Room cap min(room charge, cap*covered days) applies only to room lines in HC1. Never infer proportional reductions on related charges. Sub-limits, deductible, coinsurance and remaining cover order must be explicit approved rule program; unknown rule or ambiguity holds. C4 validates extracted numeric/date facts against normalized source values and flags contradictory originals.','Read-only calculation; no reserve or payment authorization.')
comp('C5','Review queue and timer owner','Code: human triggers',['T4.1','T4.2','T4.3'],['caseId/revision/tenantId/memberId; reasonCode and immutable packetRef required','trigger:recommendation|exception|cancel|overdue; ownerRole:adjudicator|policy_reviewer|intake_operator|duty_manager','events:{type:ack|resolve|cancel,actorId,scope,expectedRevision,at:UTC}; resolve outcome:reviewed|request_evidence,decisionNotesRef required'],['disposition:{kind:review_pending|hold_owned|cancelled,ownerRole,ackDueAt:UTC,resolveDueAt:UTC,reasonCode,packetRef?}','timer:{at:UTC,eventId,escalateTo}; queue receipts are durable store outbox entries, no email/Slack sends','humanResolution:{status:reviewed|request_evidence|overdue,actorId,at,notesRef}; records outside insurer decision ledger'], 'Create assigned queue record atomically with packet. Proposed H6 uses elapsed UTC 4h ack/48h resolution; overdue escalates at deadlines and stays visible, never auto-closes/denies. Human acknowledgment and resolution require scoped role checks and revision CAS. Request-evidence opens a new revision on new upload. Reviewer signs off outside insurer APIs; no notifications are sent by design.','Queue writes internal only; authenticated reviewers restricted by tenant, caseload and medical-data role.')
comp('C6','Case record and audit writer','Code: tools',['T1','T4.1','T4.2','T4.3'],['persist:{tenantId,memberId,caseId,expectedRevision:int,opId:uuid,payload:{kind:review_pending|hold_owned|cancelled,reasonCode,ownerRole,packet?,policyVersion?,policyHash?,ledgerSequence?,evidenceHashes:string[]},digest:sha256}; required','Canonical payload is UTF-8 JSON sorted keys/no whitespace; digest SHA256 covers all fields except digest; request identity binds opId and canonical payload','freshIdentityActive:bool from gateway; currentPolicyHash and ledgerSequence read at commit for review_pending; cancel/hold need no policy snapshot'],['commit:{status:committed|conflict|denied|stale|unknown,recordId?:uuid,revision?:int,opId,digest}; committed requires durable case row+audit+outbox IDs','error:VERSION|AUTH|POLICY_STALE|TIMEOUT_UNKNOWN; known failure returns conflict/denied/stale; transport timeout is unknown'], 'Internal logical persistDisposition API performs fresh principal scope/tenant/member checks and CAS in transaction; checks document hashes, policy registry current governing version and ledger sequence for recommendations; version changes require new revision not overwriting. OpId replay with same digest returns same receipt; changed digest is conflict. Durable proof covers record/audit/outbox before committed. Transaction failure is all-or-nothing. No insurer writes exist.','Fresh API enforcement permits only internal disposition persistence by workflow identity bound to case; no external finality or money scope.')
comp('C7','Read-only operation reconciler','Code: tools',['T4.1','T4.2','T4.3'],['lookup:{tenantId,memberId,caseId,opId,expectedDigest}; required','durable recovery identity limited to operation:read and queue escalation after caller session expires'],['reconcile:{status:found|not_found|pending|unavailable,recordId?:uuid,digest?:sha256,revision?:int}; found requires exact digest and identity','recoveryOwner:platform_on_call; nextPollAt:UTC; callback:{eventId,opId,digest,recordId} deduplicated'], 'Read operation ledger at 1/5/30 minutes, then place durable recovery hold and hourly read until operator resolution. Never blindly resubmit after timeout. not_found is not proof no delayed commit until store reports transaction definitively aborted; service guarantees must be verified H4. Freeze changed revisions/cancellation writes until result known, record intent, then separately authorize new revision. No successful completion without found receipt.','Separate durable read authority; no write or compensation permission.')
